        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>A Bad Space Game</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Game about maneuvering a Spaceship through Rings all while trying to avoid some Rocks. Think you can manage? Test your patience in 8 increasingly challenging LvL´s. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/5de5ef7bd1cfc0ba397ae2e7923a9dfa.avif?t=1779300808\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras_big/5de5ef7bd1cfc0ba397ae2e7923a9dfa.avif?t=1779300808 width=1560 height=856 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What can i expect?</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 challenging LvL´s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The LvL`s consist of flying through Rings dodging Rocks and getting boosted in-between, doesn´t sound too hard right? They get increasingly harder and faster from LvL 1-8. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/518c4388611916672b8986a9ed328b77.poster.avif?t=1779300808\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/518c4388611916672b8986a9ed328b77.webm?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/518c4388611916672b8986a9ed328b77.mp4?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the endless Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless fun in an automatically generated LvL.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compare your TImes with Friends, be fatser than them!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will remember your TImes for each LvL so you can brag to your Friends about being faster than them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/8cda5ac137ea52617051e637d1a8b645.avif?t=1779300808\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the FPV Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you fInished all 8 LvL´s you can do it again, but in FPV this time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/3ea263b4df1721604258ae3c7f742044.poster.avif?t=1779300808\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/3ea263b4df1721604258ae3c7f742044.webm?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/3ea263b4df1721604258ae3c7f742044.mp4?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy 3 different Soundtracks.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fail catastrophically!!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failing is part of the Journey, anyone can beat an easy Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/37cc8409bcc771163c93f4c939abf7d5.poster.avif?t=1779300808\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/37cc8409bcc771163c93f4c939abf7d5.webm?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/37cc8409bcc771163c93f4c939abf7d5.mp4?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/307c367e3f58c2ee338b70a4a1c73d25.poster.avif?t=1779300808\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/307c367e3f58c2ee338b70a4a1c73d25.webm?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/307c367e3f58c2ee338b70a4a1c73d25.mp4?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
