m!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will remember your TImes for each LvL so you can brag to your Friends about being faster than them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/8cda5ac137ea52617051e637d1a8b645.avif?t=1779300808\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the FPV Mode.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you fInished all 8 LvL´s you can do it again, but in FPV this time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/3ea263b4df1721604258ae3c7f742044.poster.avif?t=1779300808\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/3ea263b4df1721604258ae3c7f742044.webm?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/3ea263b4df1721604258ae3c7f742044.mp4?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy 3 different Soundtracks.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Fail catastrophically!!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failing is part of the Journey, anyone can beat an easy Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/37cc8409bcc771163c93f4c939abf7d5.poster.avif?t=1779300808\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4188340/extras/37cc8409bcc771163c93f4c939abf7d5.webm?t=1779300808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akam